      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help writing an email to my boss. we're working on the new client dashboard but the requirements keep changing and more tasks are being added every week that weren't in the original plan. i need to ask for either a deadline extension or more people on the team to help with the extra work. can you help me draft something professional?",
